{
  "key": 33827,
  "messages": [
    {
      "id": "FloaromaMeadow_Text_HandOverThatHoney",
      "en_US": [
        "Grunt 1: Enough arguing!\n",
        "Hand over that sweet Honey!\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "FloaromaMeadow_Text_DoAsWeSay",
      "en_US": [
        "Grunt 2: Do as we say!\n",
        "Team Galactic will have that Honey!\r",
        "We must have it to attract Pokémon\n",
        "in great numbers!\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "FloaromaMeadow_Text_WhatllWeDo",
      "en_US": [
        "Grunt 1: Hey! This kid is a witness!\n",
        "What’ll we do?\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "FloaromaMeadow_Text_EnsureTheBratStaysQuiet",
      "en_US": [
        "Grunt 2: We don’t need the brat\n",
        "running off to get help...\r",
        "The solution’s simple!\n",
        "We ensure the brat stays quiet!\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "FloaromaMeadow_Text_ThisIsSoLame",
      "en_US": [
        "Grunt 1: This is so lame...\n",
        "They’re going to dock my pay!\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "FloaromaMeadow_Text_ImUpNextHeheheh",
      "en_US": [
        "Grunt 2: I’m up next!\n",
        "Heheheh...\r",
        "Battling you right after my cohort\n",
        "weakened you gives me the edge!\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "FloaromaMeadow_Text_LetsGetBackToWindworks",
      "en_US": [
        "Grunt 1: This brat’s tough!\n",
        "Like, really, really tough!\r",
        "Tougher than I can put into words,\n",
        "and I know a lot of words!\r",
        "We’re done for here... Let’s get back\n",
        "to the Valley Windworks.\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "FloaromaMeadow_Text_KeyMustBeForWindworks",
      "en_US": [
        "Oh, what’s this thing?\n",
        "They seem to have forgotten it...\r",
        "It’s a Works Key...\n",
        "It must be for the Valley Windworks!\r",
        "It’s of no use to me.\n",
        "You may as well have it.\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "FloaromaMeadow_Text_ThankYouTakeALot",
      "en_US": [
        "Thank you!\n",
        "You surely saved me.\r",
        "Those goons were trying to rob me\n",
        "of my sweet, sweet Honey.\r",
        "They sure were weird, though.\n",
        "You saw how they were dressed.\r",
        "What they were saying didn’t make\n",
        "a whole lot of sense, either.\r",
        "Oh! I need to thank you!\n",
        "This sweet, sweet Honey!\f",
        "Go on, take a whole lot!\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "FloaromaMeadow_Text_SlatherHoneyOnATree",
      "en_US": [
        "Slather that Honey on a sweet-smelling\n",
        "tree. It might attract Pokémon."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "FloaromaMeadow_Text_BuySomeHoney",
      "en_US": [
        "Would you like to buy some Honey for\n",
        "attracting Pokémon? Just $100 each!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "FloaromaMeadow_Text_Dummy11",
      "garbage": 10
    },
    {
      "id": "FloaromaMeadow_Text_YourBagsFull",
      "en_US": [
        "Oh, too bad!\n",
        "Seems to me your Bag’s full.\r",
        "You can’t hold any more Honey, a shame\n",
        "though it is."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "FloaromaMeadow_Text_NotEnoughMoney",
      "en_US": [
        "Oopsy!\n",
        "You don’t have enough money."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "FloaromaMeadow_Text_OopsyWellComeAgain",
      "en_US": [
        "Oopsy!\n",
        "Well, come again."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "FloaromaMeadow_Text_Times1",
      "en_US": "X 1"
    },
    {
      "id": "FloaromaMeadow_Text_Times10",
      "en_US": "X 10"
    },
    {
      "id": "FloaromaMeadow_Text_NoThanks",
      "en_US": "NO THANKS"
    },
    {
      "id": "FloaromaMeadow_Text_Dummy18",
      "garbage": 27
    },
    {
      "id": "FloaromaMeadow_Text_SovereignGrassMasterIntro",
      "en_US": [
        "I’m the Grass-type Master!\n",
        "I aim to find the ultimate Grass-type!\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "FloaromaMeadow_Text_SovereignGrassMasterFail",
      "en_US": [
        "Come at me with only a {COLOR 1}single Pokémon{COLOR 0}\n",
        "in your party if you want to battle me.\r",
        "Oh, and there’s one other condition...\n",
        "That Pokémon must be a {COLOR 1}Grass-type{COLOR 0}!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "FloaromaMeadow_Text_SovereignGrassMasterAsk",
      "en_US": [
        "Your Grass-type looks pretty strong!\r",
        "Should we find out who has the\n",
        "ultimate Grass-type Pokémon?"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "FloaromaMeadow_Text_SovereignGrassMasterBattle",
      "en_US": "Time for a Grass-type battle!\r"
    },
    {
      "id": "FloaromaMeadow_Text_SovereignGrassMasterWin",
      "en_US": [
        "Oh, wow.\r",
        "It seems the ultimate Grass-type\n",
        "Pokémon belongs to you!\r",
        "That means you are the rightful owner\n",
        "of this precious item!\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "FloaromaMeadow_Text_SovereignGrassMasterLose",
      "en_US": [
        "The ultimate Grass-type Pokémon\n",
        "belongs to me!\r",
        "But I’m always ready for another\n",
        "Grass-type battle."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "FloaromaMeadow_Text_SovereignGrassMasterThanks",
      "en_US": [
        "Thank you for a great Grass-type\n",
        "Pokémon battle."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "FloaromaMeadow_Text_SovereignGrassMasterDecline",
      "en_US": [
        "Hmm...\n",
        "Do you feel like you can’t win?"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "FloaromaMeadow_Text_SovereignBuySomeHoneyHalf",
      "en_US": [
        "Would you like to buy some Honey for\n",
        "attracting Pokémon? Just $50 each!"
      ]
    }
  ]
}
